# Cursor Rules: Sheima & Sabir Wedding (.cursorrules)

# 1. TECH STACK & PATTERNS
- Framework: React / Next.js (App Router) or Vite + React
- Styling: Tailwind CSS
- Icons: Lucide React (lucide-react)
- Animations: Framer Motion (framer-motion) + Canvas Confetti (canvas-confetti)
- Database: Supabase Client (@supabase/supabase-js)
- Typography: Amiri (Arabic), Cormorant Garamond / Playfair Display (Serif Headings), Plus Jakarta Sans (Sans Body)

# 2. DESIGN & PALETTE CONSTRAINTS
- Strict Proscription: NEVER introduce green or emerald color classes.
- Color Tokens:
  * bg-pearl: #FAF6F0
  * bg-card: #FFFFFF
  * text-charcoal: #1F1617
  * text-muted-burgundy: #5C4A48
  * burgundy-primary: #4A0E17
  * burgundy-secondary: #7A1F2D
  * gold-primary: #D4AF37
  * gold-border: #E5C158

# 3. PROJECT DOMAIN TRUTH
- Bride: Sheima Baig (Daughter of Shaheen Baig & Shabnam Baig)
- Groom: Sabir Baig (Son of Shahid Baig & Shahida Baig)
- Grandfather: Late Wahid Baig
- Events: ONLY Haldi Ceremony (At Our Residence) and Barat Ceremony (Maanbhag Palace).
- NO Walima events or cards allowed.
- Sibling names must NOT be listed individually.

# 4. CODE IMPLEMENTATION GUIDELINES
- Mobile-First: Default class sizes optimized for 390px-430px viewport; use md: and lg: strictly for desktop layout enhancement.
- Audio Handling: All audio playback MUST originate from an explicit user tap inside the entry gate modal to respect iOS/Android autoplay security policies.
- Canvas Scratch Card: Always account for device pixel ratio (window.devicePixelRatio) when scaling <canvas> to avoid fuzzy brush strokes on high-DPI retina screens.
- Supabase Best Practices:
  * Always use typed client queries.
  * Handle loading and error states explicitly for all RSVP and Dua submissions.
  * Sanitize user input before sending to Supabase tables (wedding_rsvps, guest_duas).
- Clean Components: Keep components modular, self-contained, and strongly typed.